$ Ga-In-Sn-Sb thermodynamic database.
$ Ga-In-Sn base: this work (Ga-Sn liquid and the Ga-In-Sn ternary term from the Bayesian joint
$   optimization; Ga-In liquid 90Rug; In-Sn 04Dav; Ga in (In) 90Rug and in (beta-Sn) 92And).
$ Ga-Sb, In-Sb: Ansara et al., Calphad 18 (1994) 177 (94Ans).
$ Sn-Sb: Zhang, Wang, Yuan, Calphad 75 (2021) 102361 (21Zha), as checked by Hallstedt (SGTE
$   collection, 2024). Replaces Oh et al. 1996: SbSn and Sb3Sn4 follow Schmetterer et al. 2017.
$ (Ga,In)Sb zincblende: endmembers 94Ans, Ga-In interaction from Liao et al., Calphad 6 (1982) 155.
$ Ternary liquid terms: Ga-In-Sn (this work), Ga-In-Sb (this work, refit to the data Liao used);
$   In-Sn-Sb and Ga-Sn-Sb carry none (see the comments at the liquid).
$ Gas: SGTE substance data (Ga, Ga2, GaSb, Sb..Sb4 via 94Ans; In, In2 and Sn, Sn2 as distributed
$   with the SGTE InP and SnO datasets). InSb(g) is not included (no data located).
$ Unaries: SGTE 1991 (Dinsdale), verified against espei.refdata.
$ Correction to 04Dav: as published, the In-Sn gamma phase becomes stable as pure In above about 844 K
$ (also noted in the SGTE collection). G(GAMMA,IN) is modified above 600 K only (see the parameter).
$
ELEMENT VA   VACUUM                0.0          0.0      0.0 !
ELEMENT IN   TETRAGONAL_A6         1.14820E+02  6.6100E+03  5.7650E+01 !
ELEMENT SN   BCT_A5                1.18710E+02  6.3220E+03  5.1195E+01 !
ELEMENT GA   ORTHORHOMBIC_GA       6.97230E+01  5.5731E+03  4.0828E+01 !
ELEMENT SB   RHOMBOHEDRAL_A7       1.21750E+02  5.8702E+03  4.5522E+01 !
$
SPECIES GA2                        GA2 !
SPECIES GASB                       GA1SB1 !
SPECIES SB2                        SB2 !
SPECIES SB3                        SB3 !
SPECIES SB4                        SB4 !
SPECIES IN2                        IN2 !
SPECIES SN2                        SN2 !
$
